{"h":3396,"lines":[{"c":1,"w":0.12193959554036457,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.084067948911140417,"y":0.035032458324408489,"h":0.015253721895431283},{"y":0.080921311186471834,"h":0.017005065023828814,"c":1,"w":0.73264841715494788,"t":"corridor running left from here, and if you go along that, the door facing you at the end is the","x":0.084292856843152797},{"y":0.097383720795624185,"w":0.73045267740885411,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"entrance to the coffee room. This looks out onto the main road on one side, and some trees","x":0.084362138501854242},{"y":0.11336866911053955,"t":"on the other, and that'll be where you meet each morning.","h":0.013084819375836831,"c":1,"w":0.46090535481770833,"x":0.086419750470775422},{"w":0.73475362141927081,"t":"The factory is the very big room on the far side of the site. Next to it is the warehouse, which","h":0.017851217335048464,"x":0.084273639868883379,"y":0.13441164997603816,"c":1},{"t":"can be accessed by lorries going up the road to the turning area at the end. You can get to","c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.72427983601888024,"x":0.084362139487620405,"y":0.15106007061627691},{"y":0.16371999991589581,"w":0.73690063476562506,"h":0.019863926198934623,"x":0.08422503887338223,"t":"the warehouse by crossing to the far side of the courtyard, and then the door is on your right.","c":1},{"t":"Somewhere you'll be keen to find is the staff canteen. This is right next to reception. I can","h":0.014540019669998849,"c":1,"x":0.084362133216178664,"w":0.70987655639648439,"y":0.19040697661135519},{"c":1,"y":0.20469860633129544,"h":0.017640266598183629,"x":0.084285713805122855,"t":"confidently say that the food's very good, but the view isn't. The windows on one side look","w":0.71827072143554693},{"w":0.71206761678059893,"x":0.084298869476097979,"y":0.22052131390209606,"t":"onto a corridor and courtyard, which aren't very attractive at all, and on the other onto the","c":1,"h":0.016983079404797263},{"x":0.086419758669235971,"t":"access road, which isn't much better.","y":0.23691860452634161,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"w":0.29629628499348959},{"h":0.018648921530715734,"y":0.25868397734008775,"w":0.73885569254557293,"t":"You'll be using the meeting room quite often, and you'll find it by walking along the corridor to","x":0.084263748333013852,"c":1},{"x":0.082176606490855689,"h":0.01964475409302191,"c":1,"t":"the left of the courtyard, and continuing along it to the end. The meeting room is the last one","y":0.27202176150438218,"w":0.73484303792317707},{"c":1,"w":0.52485066731770835,"y":0.28913139822895206,"t":"on the right, and I'm afraid there's no natural daylight in the room.","h":0.016602074159188573,"x":0.082233531444505556},{"y":0.3138987041983019,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"Then you'll need to know where some of the offices are. The human resources department is","x":0.082304523455410492,"w":0.74279836018880208},{"w":0.73264241536458341,"h":0.01706820241975282,"c":1,"t":"at the front of this building, so you head to the left along the corridor from reception, and it's","y":0.32815574751851706,"x":0.082244666287647872},{"w":0.49816101074218738,"x":0.08220230976420477,"y":0.34268082492178509,"h":0.016380922252353991,"t":"the second room you come to. It looks out onto the main road.","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"And finally, the boardroom, where you'll be meeting sometimes. That has quite a pleasant","w":0.71412653605143239,"y":0.36619146692410343,"x":0.082234197119432417,"h":0.017338723541008183},{"y":0.38207961195666162,"t":"view, as it looks out on to the trees. Go along the corridor past the courtyard, right to the end.","w":0.74291956583658858,"x":0.082245580742392119,"h":0.01712044557497272,"c":1},{"y":0.39644326268329122,"w":0.38514691670735679,"h":0.016494216289902219,"c":1,"t":"The boardroom is on the left, next to the factory.","x":0.082119581182195464},{"h":0.014570836043610647,"c":1,"t":"OK, now are there any questions before we ...","w":0.37037035624186193,"y":0.42005813934370639,"x":0.084362145455886592},{"t":"Q15","w":0.039094648361206019,"x":0.85390946591198957,"y":0.082848837026341604,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"t":"Q16","x":0.85390946425051573,"y":0.13808139519280882,"w":0.039094651540120484,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"w":0.039094648361206019,"x":0.85390946591198957,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"Q17","y":0.19040697654089633,"c":1},{"t":"Q18","c":1,"x":0.85390946562412084,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.26162790681831116,"w":0.037037035624186254},{"c":1,"t":"Q19","h":0.013081395583944833,"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.31540697658815753,"x":0.85390946561806913},{"y":0.36918604637293595,"w":0.039094651540120484,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"Q20","x":0.85185185108179151},{"x":0.082268541217403957,"c":1,"h":0.014796445170336292,"y":0.47806689339787278,"t":"PART 3","w":0.1050102424621582},{"t":"JESS:","x":0.082304526220483343,"c":1,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"y":0.50872093012693598,"w":0.041152264277140305},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.039094651540120443,"y":0.5232558138166965,"x":0.080246912815902294,"t":"TOM:","c":1},{"t":"JESS:","y":0.56965759620435286,"w":0.043312546412150058,"x":0.080195578574723855,"h":0.01039410985400735,"c":1},{"t":"TOM:","y":0.61627906966484791,"x":0.082304527352515963,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186199,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"c":1,"y":0.64680232547395644,"t":"JESS:","x":0.080246913269325967,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.043209877014160167},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"TOM:","x":0.080246912804471104,"y":0.67732558125855691,"w":0.039094651540120443,"c":1},{"t":"JESS:","c":1,"x":0.078189300597661035,"y":0.70784883698853118,"w":0.045267489751180015,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.73982558129132991,"w":0.034979422887166337,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"t":"TOM:","x":0.082304527136663738},{"y":0.7543604649633372,"t":"JESS:","w":0.043209877014160153,"x":0.078189300133180553,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"w":0.039094651540120443,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"y":0.77034883708794699,"t":"TOM:","x":0.078189299641462429},{"t":"JESS:","w":0.043209877014160153,"x":0.078189300304648324,"y":0.8154069764943449,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.080246914183791679,"y":0.84738372080700686,"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.037037035624186199,"t":"тOM:"},{"y":0.86337209290505024,"w":0.043209877014160167,"c":1,"t":"JESS:","x":0.078189300073166837,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"w":0.40329218546549483,"y":0.50726744171264626,"t":"How are you getting on with your art project, Tom?","x":0.1790123433778307,"c":1,"h":0.015995219964161089},{"x":0.17891006739892248,"h":0.018850706210546408,"y":0.52076418310705974,"w":0.6113099670410157,"c":1,"t":"OK. Like, they gave us the theme of birds to base our project on, and I'm not"},{"c":1,"h":0.016339102117136406,"y":0.53757355503696858,"w":0.61945927937825518,"x":0.1768921428201303,"t":"really all that interested in wildlife. But I'm starting to get into it. I've pretty well"},{"h":0.017973136003222367,"c":1,"t":"finished the introductory stage.","x":0.17662597567572305,"y":0.55144212050400077,"w":0.2517265319824219},{"t":"So have I. When they gave us all those handouts with details of books and","h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"x":0.17901233959312474,"w":0.59465021769205739,"y":0.56831395335479051},{"x":0.17695472890681629,"y":0.58421672559493942,"w":0.63374486287434895,"t":"websites to look at, I was really put off, but the more I read, the more interested","h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"w":0.64814814249674479,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"Me too. I found I could research so many different aspects of birds in art - colour,","y":0.61482558126053266,"c":1,"x":0.1769547351498531},{"y":0.63074204923075117,"t":"movement, texture. So I was looking forward to the Bird Park visit.","x":0.17695472864794265,"h":0.01472320376914027,"c":1,"w":0.52469136555989593},{"c":1,"x":0.17892783816275748,"y":0.64508187448620513,"t":"What a letdown! It poured with rain and we hardly saw a single bird. Much less","w":0.62567403157552082,"h":0.016694314909486807},{"x":0.17695472847187707,"t":"use than the trip to the Natural History Museum.","y":0.66133720916655614,"w":0.38683128356933594,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"y":0.67450698081072746,"w":0.60116017659505205,"c":1,"x":0.17678364684046821,"t":"Yeah. I liked all the stuff about evolution there. The workshop sessions with","h":0.019070920730788532},{"t":"Dr Fletcher were good too, especially the brainstorming sessions.","x":0.17887429626273313,"y":0.69050940237821423,"h":0.017810187996908033,"w":0.52496175130208333,"c":1},{"w":0.6380638122558594,"t":"I missed those because I was ill. I wish we could've seen the projects last year's","x":0.17890051061613899,"y":0.70646062592501224,"h":0.016603105902250559,"c":1},{"h":0.015464800687504665,"y":0.72191876242684772,"x":0.17683206299375864,"w":0.10724122365315752,"t":"students did.","c":1},{"x":0.17683951329763148,"c":1,"t":"Mm. I suppose they want us to do our own thing, not copy.","y":0.73766145513827208,"w":0.4673260498046875,"h":0.01717633156388898},{"t":"Have you drafted your proposal yet?","c":1,"w":0.29448354085286454,"h":0.016257202948220861,"x":0.17681643793545979,"y":0.75283169382678872},{"w":0.60520024617513024,"t":"Yes, but I haven't handed it in. I need to amend some parts. I've realised the","y":0.76739756521551972,"h":0.017685691936838888,"x":0.17887268793912484,"c":1},{"x":0.17677675999043516,"y":0.78176261330712338,"h":0.020347714283721841,"c":1,"t":"notes from my research are almost all just descriptions, Ihaven't actually","w":0.58678263346354165},{"t":"evaluated anything. So I'll have to fix that.","x":0.17695473232921813,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"w":0.33333333333333337,"y":0.79941860449147772},{"w":0.60509913126627601,"t":"Oh, I didn't know we had to do that. IIl have to look at that too. Did you do a","h":0.017928369474916495,"x":0.17687357471961082,"y":0.81382548612173311,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.17489712183002798,"y":0.83127208488918503,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.19135801951090498,"t":"timeline for the project?"},{"x":0.17663880628122486,"c":1,"w":0.1796017837524414,"y":0.84577772442004084,"t":"Yes, and a mind map.","h":0.01654786131266861},{"t":"Yeah, so did I. I quite enjoyed that. But it was hard having to explain the basis for","h":0.018105754021059406,"w":0.64631261189778644,"y":0.86040742734168307,"c":1,"x":0.17682750542092948},{"y":0.87632508817919408,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226243,"t":"my decisions in my action plan.","x":0.17695473180528429,"w":0.25308642069498699},{"t":"Q21\/Q22","w":0.076393744150797471,"h":0.013864580116227043,"c":1,"x":0.83114469156360127,"y":0.56937584944681419},{"y":0.78622556243493036,"x":0.831237582665172,"w":0.076207962036132781,"c":1,"h":0.013304689045648854,"t":"Q23\/Q24"},{"w":0.037037035624186199,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.90697674401000972,"t":"100","x":0.080246914183791679},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.95570565063906143,"c":1,"x":0.71954105236895316,"h":0.026887280359706223,"w":0.25424112955729161}],"w":2400}